# English translations of the property descriptions (source: the Dutch listings on pc-spain.com).
C_ = '<p><a href="en-intake.html">Interested? Get in touch</a></p>'
LUXE_VLC = ('<p>Located in one of the most luxurious residential complexes between the Costa de Valencia and the Costa de Azahar, next to one of the best beaches of the Mediterranean. This beautiful complex offers two types of homes: standard and premium.</p>'
            '<p>A parking space and storage room are included. On the 20th floor of the complex there is an infinity pool with panoramic views, as well as a gym, sauna and padel courts. The complex has 24-hour security.</p>'
            '<p>The apartment is just a few minutes’ walk from the beach, a 25-minute drive from the city of Valencia and 30 minutes from Valencia airport.</p>')
GRANADELLA = ('<p>These beautiful villas are part of a project of 24 homes, finished in a modern, avant-garde style. They are being built just 2.5 kilometres from the beach.</p>'
              '<p>The project offers a choice of 3 villa models, and bespoke changes are possible. As standard the homes have 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. If you are thinking of luxury, these tastefully designed homes are perfect! Plot sizes vary from around 250 m2 up to no less than 1,000 m2 per plot. A big advantage: building permits have already been granted.</p>'
              '<p>Jávea means a beautiful azure sea, lovely beaches and a Mediterranean climate. The town itself offers every luxury and convenience, such as shops, schools and good restaurants. You will also find the best beaches and coves with crystal-clear water in the Valencian Community and Spain.</p>')
GRAN_ALACANT_AREA = '<p>Nearby there are shops, restaurants, supermarkets, schools, pharmacies, banks and bus stops. Alicante–Elche airport, which connects many European cities with the Costa Blanca, is only 15 minutes away.</p>'
BENISSA_DESIGN_REST = ('<p>The ground floor has 2 spacious bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and en-suite bathrooms; both bedrooms open onto the main terrace. There is also a guest toilet, a modern, fully fitted kitchen with built-in top-brand appliances and a separate utility room with laundry that opens onto its own terrace. The open kitchen connects to a large living and dining room with beautiful views through large windows onto the spacious sun terrace with a 66 m2 infinity pool and a barbecue. Upstairs there are 2 more bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes, en-suite bathrooms and private terraces.</p>'
                       '<p>The whole property is surrounded by a beautiful, fully landscaped garden with automatic irrigation. The plot has 2 entrances with automatic gates, each with parking for 2 cars. Extras: barbecue area, infinity pool, indoor pool, sauna, gym, wine cellar, garage for 3 cars, parking for 4 cars, 2 entrances, landscaped garden with automatic irrigation, ducted air conditioning, underfloor heating, home automation, indoor/outdoor alarm system + pre-installation for cameras, lift, south facing, sea views, automatic entrance gates.</p>')

EN_LISTINGS = {
 '39-appartementen-denia': ('39 apartments Dénia', '<p><strong>Ref: Buenavista Residencial – TR</strong></p><p>A new residential development in the best neighbourhood of the town, combined with unrivalled build quality. Imagine living at the foot of the mountain while enjoying the proximity of the sea, all in a dynamic, modern urban setting where you lack nothing.</p><p>The building has everything to make your life a dream: a modern, functional design that makes your home warm, light, quiet and comfortable. You get a fitted kitchen, hot and cold air conditioning, state-of-the-art flooring, smooth paint finishes throughout, a special thermal insulation system and, of course, your own garage space.</p><p>The residence has a chill-out area on the roof with a swimming pool, a children’s playground and a Zen, Mediterranean-style garden. It is located in La Pedrera, a central district of Dénia with every service within reach: schools, supermarkets, healthcare, shops and gyms.</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-altea-met-zeezicht': ('Apartment Altea with sea view', '<p><strong>Ref. AP2565 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Apartment Altea sea view</strong></p><p>This high-quality apartment is right on the beach. It has 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms and underfloor heating throughout. The living room has a natural-stone feature wall, the kitchen is open-plan and the apartment is furnished with solid wood furniture. Electric awnings in the living room and master bedroom keep it cool, and the home also has air conditioning and built-in appliances, and comes furnished.</p><p>This lovely home, with a 25 m2 terrace, has wonderful views of the Mediterranean and the garden with its large swimming pool. It is part of a new, gated apartment complex on the beach. Good to know: the apartment is wheelchair accessible and only a ten-minute walk from Altea town centre.</p><p>The price includes an underground parking space.</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-costa-blanca-3-slaapkamers': ('Apartment Benidorm', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2085 NR</strong></p><p><strong>3-bedroom apartment with beautiful sea views – Design Resort in Benidorm</strong></p><p>A 3-bedroom apartment less than 200 metres from the beach, in a fantastic new residential area of Benidorm, facing south with private terraces of 19 m2 and more. A large central square of 10,300 m² offers a range of facilities, including several large swimming pools, a heated pool, a gym with professional equipment, a sauna, outdoor table tennis and a children’s playground. The two towers contain homes with 2, 3 and 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms (4-bedroom apartments have 3 bathrooms). On the top floor there are exclusive penthouses with private hot tubs and high-end finishes. The development is wheelchair friendly and easy to get around.</p><p>The apartments have beautiful views over the grounds and/or the sea. The residence offers two types of home, Excellence and Premium, so you can choose between two levels of finish, both detailed for maximum comfort. Every home includes a parking space, outdoors or in the basement, and a storage room. Homes can still be personalised at the current construction stage – at very attractive prices!</p><p>Excellent connections to the N-332 and the AP7 motorway to Alicante and Valencia (Alicante airport is 40 minutes away).</p><p>The residence is in an established area with all kinds of services and leisure options, very close to the centre of Benidorm.</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-costa-blanca-zuid': ('Apartment Costa Blanca South', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2608 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Apartment Costa Blanca South</strong></p><p>A lovely Mediterranean-style apartment a stone’s throw from the sandy beaches. The residence has a communal pool and gardens and is close to several golf courses, beaches, restaurants and shops.</p><p>The apartment has two bedrooms, two bathrooms and air conditioning. The complex was built in 2020 and has a communal garden and pool.</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-denia': ('Apartment Dénia', '<p><strong>Ref: APG2464 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Superb beachside apartment in Dénia</strong></p><p>A beautiful open-plan 1-bedroom apartment with a spacious living room, open kitchen and a terrace with open views over the communal gardens and the sea. The kitchen is fully fitted with oven, induction hob and extractor hood.</p><p>This lovely home is a stone’s throw from Almadraba beach in Dénia, a cosmopolitan town full of active tourism, gastronomy and leisure. The complex is walled with its own security gate, and is easily reached from the Carretera de Les Marines, with a bus stop just a few metres away for the town centre. A long cycle path runs along the Carretera de Les Marines for pleasant rides. Shops, supermarkets and restaurants are less than 500 metres away, and golfers are only 15 minutes from the famous Oliva Nova course.</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-dichtbij-strand-valencia': ('Apartment near the beach Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2619 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Apartment near the beach in Valencia</strong></p><p>The apartment is on the 8th floor and has 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and a 17 m2 terrace with spectacular views.</p>' + LUXE_VLC + C_),
 'appartement-gran-alacant': ('Apartment Gran Alacant', '<p><strong>Ref: APG2607 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Turnkey, beautiful apartment in Gran Alacant</strong></p><p>A 70 m2 ground-floor apartment with 2 bedrooms and a 13 m2 terrace in a new complex in Gran Alacant, on the beach with unique dunes and pine woods. It comes with designer furniture, white goods, household items and top-quality materials. There is a gym with open views, an outdoor pool for adults and children, a heated hot tub, a relaxation area, green spaces and bicycle storage – all with beautiful panoramic sea views.</p>' + GRAN_ALACANT_AREA + C_),
 'appartement-in-lolla-cap-negret-altea': ('Apartment in L’Olla-Cap Negret Altea', '<p><strong>Ref. AP2601 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Apartment in L’Olla-Cap Negret Altea</strong></p><p>Just 60 metres from Altea beach is this lovely 3-bedroom apartment. The master bedroom has a double bed and a neat en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom has a double bed plus a single bed and its own shower room with toilet.</p><p>New air conditioning was recently installed, and a parking space is included. There is a communal pool and garden.</p><p>Around Cap Negret you will find restaurants, a supermarket, a pharmacy and water-sports facilities. You can easily walk to the centre of Altea along the ‘green mile’, past beautiful olive, almond and orange trees!</p>' + C_),
 'appartement-met-groot-terras-valencia': ('Apartment with large terrace Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2620 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Apartment with a large terrace in Valencia</strong></p><p>A beautiful standard apartment on the 1st floor with 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a 21 m2 terrace.</p><p>Located in one of the most luxurious residential complexes between the Costa de Valencia and the Costa de Azahar, next to one of the best beaches of the Mediterranean. This beautiful complex offers two types of homes: standard and premium.</p><p>Homes with 1 to 4 bedrooms · large terraces with sea views · parking space and storage included · swimming pool and heated pool · infinity pool on the 20th floor with panoramic views · gym, sauna and padel courts · playground · social club / bar · solarium, chill-out area and summer house · 24-hour security</p><p>Just a few minutes’ walk from the beach, a 25-minute drive from the city of Valencia and 30 minutes from Valencia airport. Interested in this home?</p>' + C_),
 'bodega-xativa': ('Bodega Xàtiva', '<p><strong>Ref: Bodega Xativa – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Bodega to restore near Xàtiva</strong></p><p>The property has 700 m2 of living space spread over several buildings, on a plot of more than 160,000 m2.</p><p>A few kilometres from Xàtiva, a town steeped in history, this bodega is for sale for restoration. The buildings have been vandalised but are easy to restore to your own taste, with many possible layouts.</p><p>A fine property for an investment.</p>' + C_),
 'chalet-gandia': ('Chalet Gandia', '<p><strong>Ref: Chalet Gandia – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Three-bedroom chalet in Gandia</strong></p><p>A chalet in Gandia, 10 km from the beach, with 89 m2 of living space on a plot of more than 25,000 m2. It has 3 bedrooms, a bathroom, a simple kitchen and a lovely sitting room.</p><p>The orange trees on the land yield around €5,000 a year, enough to cover the running costs. The chalet has a permanent electricity connection.</p><p>With Gandia and its beautiful beaches so close, combined with the countryside, this property is the ‘best of both worlds’ for lovers of rural Spain – you even have a private wooded hill in the back garden.</p>' + C_),
 'chalet-pedreguer': ('Chalet Pedreguer', '<p><strong>Ref: Chalet Pedreguer – TR</strong></p><p><strong>A 2-bedroom chalet in Pedreguer</strong></p><p>The chalet has 131 m2 of living space on a 573 m2 plot, with 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms over 2 floors. The ground floor has a small open kitchen and a living room with dining area, plus a bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a bathroom.</p><p>The first floor has a living room with dining area, a separate kitchen, a bedroom and a bathroom.</p><p>This home has breathtaking views.</p>' + C_),
 'drie-slaapkamer-villa-javea': ('Three-bedroom villa Jávea', '<p><strong>Ref: Villa Javea – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Three-bedroom villa Jávea</strong></p><p>This 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom villa of approx. 170 m2 on more than 2,000 m2 of land is only a 10-minute drive from the beaches of both Jávea and Moraira, and offers plenty of privacy, green walking country and peace and quiet.</p><p>Everything is on one level and very easy to maintain – ready to move into. Central heating runs on oil. Price: €398,000 plus buyer’s costs.</p>' + C_),
 'familie-villa-benissa': ('Family villa Benissa', '<p><strong>Ref: LUX2621 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Family villa in Benissa</strong></p><p>A large family home with a huge 65 m2 master bedroom with walk-in closet and a beautiful bathroom! Located in the Benissa Costa area, just a 3-minute drive from the beautiful coves of Cala Llobella and Cala Advocat.</p><p>The villa has a 39 m2 living room with an open kitchen (12.5 m2) with cooking island and plenty of storage. The ground floor has 2 bedrooms, one with an en-suite shower room, plus a second guest bathroom with shower. There is a generous storage space under the stairs for the washing machine.</p><p>The entire upper floor is the master bedroom with a very large en-suite bathroom with freestanding bath, shower, double basin and toilet. The best part of the master suite is the large 7.5 m2 walk-in closet, next to a full-width wardrobe. The master bedroom opens directly onto the 70 m2 roof terrace (also reached by the outside stairs from the garden). Outside, the villa offers lots of space with spots in sun or shade all day. There is of course a private pool (3.5 x 8.5 m) and both covered and open terraces. The garden is easy to maintain and partly laid with artificial grass. There is parking for 2 cars on the plot. Features: pre-installed air conditioning, electric shutters in living room and bedroom, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, electric boiler. Kitchen: no appliances included.</p>' + C_),
 'finca-gata-de-gorgos': ('Finca Gata de Gorgos', '<p><strong>Ref: Finca Gata de Gorgos – Xàtiva – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Two-bedroom finca in Gata de Gorgos</strong></p><p>This beautiful finca has 300 m2 of living space on a 2,500 m2 plot. It has 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, plus 2 apartments.</p><p>Each apartment has a bedroom, a bathroom, cooking facilities and a sitting and dining area. The finca has mains water, electricity and solar power. The garden offers several terraces and a swimming pool.</p>' + C_),
 'herenhuis-costa-blanca-noord': ('Townhouse Costa Blanca North', '<p><strong>Ref: APG2607 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Turnkey townhouses on the beach in Santa Pola</strong></p><p>A lovely move-in-ready townhouse in a small residential development in the best part of Santa Pola, just 50 metres from supermarkets, shops and cafés. The complex is built around the communal pool.</p><p>This home has 2 floors, 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, a large underground garage for two cars with storage, and a private solarium.</p>' + C_),
 'herenhuis-in-sierra-cortina': ('Townhouse in Sierra Cortina', '<p><strong>Ref. ADO2613 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Three-bedroom townhouse</strong></p><p>A beautiful townhouse with garden in the exclusive resort of Sierra Cortina, with 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a guest toilet. The Sierra Cortina resort has 24/7 security and restaurants, and its sports club is very close to the leisure complex. The area is connected to the AP-7 exit and close to the region’s shopping area: CC La Marina, Carrefour, Leroy Merlin, Mercadona, Decathlon and more.</p><p>The house has air conditioning, a garden, its own parking space and a shared swimming pool.</p>' + C_),
 'herenhuis-sierra-cortina-2': ('Townhouse Sierra Cortina', '<p><strong>Ref: LUX2616 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Exclusive luxury villas in Benidorm</strong></p><p>In a quiet setting away from the noise, yet in the heart of Benidorm, these 6 exclusive high-end villas sit on a hill surrounded by green areas, parks and trees, with beautiful views over the city, the sea and the mountains. The location puts all kinds of services close by – schools, medical centres, shops, golf courses and shopping centres – all within walking distance of the historic centre and the beach. Built to the highest standards, each house has two floors plus a basement with an English patio that brings in natural light. The ground floor has a hall, living room and kitchen, a bedroom and bathroom, and a porch with access to the pool. Upstairs are two bedrooms with private bathrooms, a dressing room, a solarium and an open terrace. The basement has several rooms, including a plant room, a multi-purpose room, a laundry, a storage room and two English patios. The basement can be used freely, and an extra bedroom and bathroom can be added. Costs: €10,900</p>' + C_),
 'herenhuis-sierra-cortina': ('Townhouse Sierra Cortina', '<p><strong>Ref: ADO2618 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Beautiful townhouse in Sierra Cortina</strong></p><p>A lovely townhouse with garden in the exclusive resort of Sierra Cortina, with 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a guest toilet. The Sierra Cortina resort, with 24/7 security, restaurants and a sports club, is very close to the leisure complex: Asia Gardens Hotel, golf courses, Villa Aitana Hotel and the Terra Mítica theme park. It is connected to the AP-7 exit and the region’s shopping area: CC La Marina, Carrefour, Leroy Merlin, Mercadona, Decathlon and more – plus all the services of the Costa Blanca’s biggest tourist centre.</p>' + C_),
 'la-granadella-villa-a': ('La Granadella – Villa A', '<p><strong>Ref. KP</strong></p><p><strong>Spectacular luxury villa</strong></p>' + GRANADELLA),
 'la-granadella-villa-b': ('La Granadella – Villa B', '<p><strong>Ref. KP</strong></p><p><strong>Spectacular luxury villas</strong></p>' + GRANADELLA),
 'la-granadella-villa-c': ('La Granadella – Villa C', '<p><strong>Ref. KP</strong></p><p><strong>Spectacular luxury villas</strong></p>' + GRANADELLA),
 'la-llosa-de-ranes-xativa': ('La Llosa de Ranes Xàtiva', '<p><strong>Ref: La Llosa de Ranes – Xàtiva – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Three-bedroom finca near Xàtiva</strong></p><p>If you love peace and quiet and beautiful green surroundings – and would like to earn something too – this modern 3-bedroom finca of 100 m2 on around 30,000 m2 of land full of citrus trees could be just right. The citrus harvest yields between 18 and 20 thousand euros a year.</p><p>There is water and more than enough green power – solar panels and a wind turbine – to run the whole house. The house has a swimming pool with a spacious terrace and breathtaking views.</p><p>La Llosa de Ranes is 3 kilometres from one of the most beautiful inland towns, Xàtiva, which has an English international school if you have children of school age. There is plenty of culture and lovely little restaurants, so you won’t be lonely here.</p><p>The price is excellent and earned back within 10 years!</p>' + C_),
 'landhuis-tarbena': ('Country house Tàrbena', '<p><strong>Ref. FINCA2593 NR</strong></p><p>Secluded, completely private and surrounded by mountains, this beautiful, fully renovated home is a true dream. A private road leads to this oasis of peace and beauty, away from the crowds. It is about a 5-minute drive from Tàrbena, a town with all services, shops, a school and a health centre. On a plot of more than 10,000 m2, the single-storey home has 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, a living room, dining room, kitchen and a large basement currently converted into a gym. There are also 3 terraces and a roof terrace with panoramic views, a barbecue, a cosy outdoor bar beside the pool with 2 exciting fast water slides, diving platforms with a depth of 3 metres and beautiful waterfalls, a large sunbathing area, a garage and storage. The interior has been tastefully renovated and modernised while keeping its rustic character. Included: underfloor heating, alarm, top-class solar power, generator system (mains electricity possible if desired) and a good internet connection.</p>' + C_),
 'luxe-appartement-2-slaapkamers-valencia': ('Luxury apartment 2 bedrooms Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2612 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Luxury apartment Valencia</strong></p><p>The apartment is on the 18th floor and has 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a 27 m2 terrace with spectacular views.</p>' + LUXE_VLC + C_),
 'luxe-appartement-3-slaapkamers-valencia': ('Luxury apartment 3 bedrooms Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2609 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Luxury apartment Valencia</strong></p><p>The apartment is on the 16th floor and has 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a 39 m2 terrace with spectacular views.</p>' + LUXE_VLC + C_),
 'luxe-appartement-valencia': ('Luxury apartment 4 bedrooms Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: AP2611 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Luxury apartment Valencia</strong></p><p>The apartment is on the 12th floor and has 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and an 86 m2 terrace with spectacular sea views and an optional jacuzzi.</p>' + LUXE_VLC + C_),
 'luxe-design-villa-in-benissa': ('Luxury design villa in Benissa', '<p><strong>Ref: LUX2602 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Exclusive luxury design villa in Benissa</strong></p><p>This beautiful property is spread over 3 floors connected by a lift and stairs. The lower floor has an indoor pool with a large relaxation area, a gym, a sauna, a bar, a bathroom, a wine cellar and a garage for 3 cars.</p>' + BENISSA_DESIGN_REST + C_),
 'luxe-penthouse-valencia': ('Luxury penthouse Valencia', '<p><strong>Ref: ATC2610 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Luxury penthouse Valencia</strong></p><p>The penthouse is on the 19th floor and has 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a 50 m2 terrace with spectacular views.</p>' + LUXE_VLC + C_),
 'luxe-villa-moraira': ('Luxury villa Moraira', '<p><strong>Ref. LUX2603 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Beautiful villa Moraira</strong></p><p>This beautiful modern villa has wonderful sea views and is in a quiet neighbourhood. The beach and the centre of Moraira are both only 2.5 kilometres away.</p><p>The home is spread over 3 floors. The ground floor has 1 bedroom with en-suite bathroom, a toilet and the kitchen, plus the generous living room opening onto the 48 m2 outdoor terrace and the large pool.</p><p>The first floor has 3 bedrooms, each with its own bathroom, and two terraces. The basement has a large 44 m2 garage, and outside there is a carport and room to park several vehicles.</p><p>The whole home has underfloor heating, air conditioning, electric shutters and an indoor alarm. It also has solar panels and several fitted wardrobes, as well as a 22 m2 barbecue area, laundry room, landscaped garden with automatic irrigation and automatic gates.</p><p>This house faces south.</p>'),
 'mediterraanse-villa-altea': ('Mediterranean villa Altea', '<p><strong>Ref. LUX2579 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Mediterranean villa</strong></p><p>A large Mediterranean villa with all facilities on the ground floor, built on a long plot in the hills of Altea with lots of privacy. The villa was designed to bring in as much natural light as possible.</p><p>The home has a spacious hall, off which lies the first bedroom with a lovely en-suite bathroom; the guest toilet is also reached from the hall. There is a dining room with adjoining kitchen and laundry. The living room has an open fireplace, and beautiful French doors open onto the covered terrace with wonderful views of the Mediterranean and the church of Altea.</p><p>Behind the covered terrace is a second bedroom with en-suite bathroom. The first floor has a large space that can be used as a master bedroom with en-suite bathroom and sitting area, or as a home office with bedroom and bathroom.</p><p>The garden has a pool and an excellent outdoor kitchen for ‘al fresco dining’. Privacy is further ensured by the beautiful mature garden, which is easy to maintain yet very green with lots of flowers and plants. The pool is perfect for spending both day and evening.</p><p>By car, the entrance is at the side of the house, where the underground garage is. From the garage a footpath with a few steps leads to the main entrance.</p>' + C_),
 'moderne-villa-javea': ('Modern villa Jávea', '<p><strong>Ref. LUX2586 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Modern new-build villa in Jávea</strong></p><p>This beautiful new-build villa has wonderful mountain views. The ground floor has a spacious living room with open kitchen, and sliding doors open directly onto the covered terraces. There is a spacious bedroom with en-suite bathroom (including bath) and dressing room, a lobby and a toilet.</p><p>Upstairs are two bedrooms with en-suite bathrooms, both with access to a covered terrace.</p><p>Outside there are several terraces and a pergola, and the garden is low-maintenance. The villa also has a private pool with a view.</p>' + C_),
 'penthouse-altea': ('Penthouse Altea', '<p><strong>Ref: ATC2604 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Property investment: penthouse in Altea</strong></p><p>A 1-bedroom apartment, currently let. A fantastic penthouse with beautiful sea views and direct access to the beach and promenade of Altea.</p><p>Residence with communal pool and garden. Built in 1972.</p>' + C_),
 'penthouse-gran-alacant': ('Penthouse Gran Alacant', '<p><strong>Ref: ATC2608 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Turnkey, beautiful penthouse in Gran Alacant</strong></p><p>A fully equipped, beautiful penthouse with a 58 m2 private solarium in a new complex in Gran Alacant, on the beach with unique dunes and pine woods. It comes with designer furniture, white goods, household items and top-quality materials. There is a gym with open views, an outdoor pool for adults and children, a heated hot tub, a relaxation area, green spaces and bicycle storage – all with beautiful panoramic sea views.</p>' + GRAN_ALACANT_AREA + C_),
 'plaza-pintor-segrelles': ('Plaza Pintor Segrelles', '<p><strong>Sunny, spacious apartment in the heart of Valencia</strong></p><p>This apartment – Casa del Zorro – is spacious, with high ceilings, large windows and two French balconies at the front with a beautiful view, surrounded by cosy little restaurants. Stay cool (or warm) with a fully integrated air-conditioning system.</p><p>Comfortable double beds, a completely new, spacious bathroom with shower since December 2019, a large fully fitted kitchen and a lovely living room with TV including Dutch and Belgian channels. This is a new, very light, spacious and cosy flat with double glazing, a completely new kitchen, living room and large bedrooms. All materials are top quality, and all kitchenware and appliances are included. It is on the first floor; there is no lift.</p><p><strong>Offered for</strong> €235,000 including furniture, €230,000 without furniture.</p>'),
 'traditionele-villa-javea': ('Traditional villa Jávea', '<p><strong>Ref: 1VI07545 NR</strong></p><p>A traditional villa, ideally located for amenities including a supermarket, restaurants and an international school, and just 450 metres from the lovely cove of Cala Blanca. Arenal beach is a 20-minute walk.</p><p>This beautiful traditional villa was designed by a renowned architect and has many of his signature features. It has 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, an open living/dining room with fireplace, kitchen, covered terrace and roof terrace, all surrounded by a level garden with lawn, planted beds and palm trees, with room for a private pool. There is a garage and off-road parking, plus a bus stop nearby, and open green views towards the Montgó.</p>' + BENISSA_DESIGN_REST + C_),
 'tuinappartement-altea': ('Garden apartment Altea', '<p><strong>Ref: APG2614 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Garden apartment with large terrace in Altea la Vella</strong></p><p>A spacious apartment with 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a guest toilet, with superb outdoor space: a garden and terrace at the front and a large open and covered patio with kitchen and barbecue, plus a room currently used for storage. It is in the centre of picturesque Altea la Vella, with views of the beautiful mountains and about 2 km from the beach, within walking distance of shops, restaurants and supermarkets. Altea la Vella is well connected to the AP7 and by bus to Altea. The price includes an underground parking space and an extra storage room in the garage.</p>' + C_),
 'tuinappartement-orihuela': ('Garden apartment Orihuela', '<p><strong>Ref: APG2600 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Turnkey: lovely garden apartment in a golf resort</strong></p><p>A stylish, fully furnished home with 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, living room, open kitchen with built-in appliances, terrace, private garden, parking, storage room, lift and fibre-optic internet, with lovely outdoor space including a communal pool and gardens. It is in a private part of a Golf and Country Club with 24-hour security, in a beautiful valley between hills near the sea, with a golf course running through it. An eco-friendly setting with golf within walking distance and, a short drive away, marinas, shopping centres, a beach club, international schools, nature reserves and an international hospital. 50 minutes from Alicante international airport.</p>' + C_),
 'villa-6-slaapkamers-javea': ('Villa 6 bedrooms Jávea', '<p><strong>Ref: 1VI07547 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Villa with 6 bedrooms in Jávea</strong></p><p>A villa on a 1,941 m2 plot with 248 m² built, divided into three parts: the main house on one floor, a self-contained two-bedroom apartment on the ground floor and a self-contained studio on the top floor.</p><p>Entering through the electric gates you find gravel parking for many cars and a separate lockable pedestrian gate. The mature, well-kept gardens offer lots of room to make your mark, and there is even space to build further if needed. There is a barbecue area, an outdoor shower and plenty of covered areas to enjoy outdoor living out of the glare of the sun. The pool is larger than average at 12 m x 6 m and is surrounded by a Spanish tosca-stone patio. The whole large plot is securely fenced and completely private. More than half of the plot borders a ‘Zona Verde’, the equivalent of Green Belt land in the UK.</p><p>The main villa has three bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, 2 en-suite bathrooms and a further separate bathroom, together with the living room, kitchen and separate utility room.</p><p>The self-contained apartment has a living/dining room and kitchen – a lounge with two sofas, a fully equipped kitchen including washing machine and a dining table for six – 1 bedroom with fitted wardrobe, storage and an en-suite with shower, vanity unit and toilet, and 1 further bedroom with fitted wardrobe; next to bedroom 2 is a separate toilet and a separate shower and basin.</p><p>Another self-contained apartment, reached by an outside staircase, is a studio: the living and sleeping area has a large wardrobe and a TV/relaxation area. The kitchen has everything you need to be self-sufficient, and there is a separate large shower room with basin, a separate toilet and a washing machine. The studio has the benefit of its own private roof terrace.</p><p>The property is conveniently located just a few minutes’ drive from several supermarkets and other amenities, while Arenal beach is just over 5 minutes away by car.</p>' + C_),
 'villa-costa-blanca-noord': ('Villa Costa Blanca North', '<p><strong>Ref: 1VI07530 NR</strong></p><p><strong>Villa on the Costa Blanca North</strong></p><p>This traditional 4-bedroom villa is on a private 1,500 m² plot close to Arenal beach and its amenities. It is reached by a private driveway and has views of the open sea and the valley.</p><p>The grounds are largely low-maintenance, with typical Mediterranean trees and plants and some lawns.</p><p>The lower floor has a generous garage next to a large storeroom, with good potential for further development if needed, and a bedroom suite with a large bathroom.</p><p>The first floor has 3 more double bedrooms and two bathrooms, together with the large living room leading to both the kitchen and the spacious naya (covered terrace) – the place to enjoy the beautiful views. The property is offered in good condition and also has good potential for further development.</p>' + C_),
 'villa-in-beniarbeig': ('Villa in Beniarbeig', '<p><strong>Ref: Villa Beniarbeig – TR</strong></p><p><strong>Villa in Beniarbeig with its own traditional bar</strong></p><p>This villa has 560 m2 of living space on a 3,700 m2 plot, all on one level: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a library, an office and its own traditional ‘brown café’ bar. The garden has a large swimming pool.</p><p>The property is zoned for leisure/hospitality (ocio/hostelería), so you could turn it into a club, hotel or very luxurious B&amp;B.</p><p>If you are looking for something completely different and want to combine peace &amp; 100% privacy with the proximity of Dénia and the coast, you should definitely see this villa. This huge, once-in-a-lifetime villa of 560 m2 on 3,700 m2 of land is one of a kind. The entire roof is accessible, with 360° views over the surroundings, and everything is in perfect condition.</p>' + C_),
}
